个交易对分析的数据框。","position":{"start":{"line":78,"column":1},"end":{"line":78,"column":1}},"key":"tuUyUqjRLm"}],"key":"oqL93ev8og"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":80,"column":1},"end":{"line":80,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"然后，消费者实例将拥有分析数据框的完整副本，而无需自己计算它们。","position":{"start":{"line":80,"column":1},"end":{"line":80,"column":1}},"key":"akkm68uwg8"}],"key":"RHbSNGnfcZ"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":1},"end":{"line":84,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"示例","position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":1},"end":{"line":84,"column":1}},"key":"vyp8orfmkN"}],"label":"examples","identifier":"examples","html_id":"examples","key":"wKS9ZBgnOU"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":88,"column":1},"end":{"line":88,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"示例 - 生产者策略","position":{"start":{"line":88,"column":1},"end":{"line":88,"column":1}},"key":"ZuoJTUjyiJ"}],"label":"example-producer-strategy","identifier":"example-producer-strategy","html_id":"example-producer-strategy","key":"Hr5tTLkeVz"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":90,"column":1},"end":{"line":90,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"一个具有多个指标的简单策略。策略本身不需要特殊考虑。","position":{"start":{"line":90,"column":1},"end":{"line":90,"column":1}},"key":"DYmWqrE8hU"}],"key":"MvlC85NBTM"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","value":"class ProducerStrategy(IStrategy):\n    #...\n    def populate_indicators(self, dataframe: DataFrame, metadata: dict) -> DataFrame:\n        \"\"\"\n        以标准的 freqtrade 方式计算指标，然后可以广播到其他实例\n        \"\"\"\n        dataframe['rsi'] = ta.RSI(dataframe)\n        bollinger = qtpylib.bollinger_bands(qtpylib.typical_price(dataframe), window=20, stds=2)\n        dataframe['bb_lowerband'] = bollinger['lower']\n        dataframe['bb_middleband'] = bollinger['mid']\n        dataframe['bb_upperband'] = bollinger['upper']\n        dataframe['tema'] = ta.TEMA(dataframe, timeperiod=9)\n\n        return dataframe\n\n    def populate_entry_trend(self, dataframe: DataFrame, metadata: dict) -> DataFrame:\n        \"\"\"\n        为给定的数据框填充入场信号\n        \"\"\"\n        dataframe.loc[\n            (\n                (qtpylib.crossed_above(dataframe['rsi'], self.buy_rsi.value)) &\n                (dataframe['tema'] <= dataframe['bb_middleband']) &\n                (dataframe['tema'] > dataframe['tema'].shift(1)) &\n                (dataframe['volume'] > 0)\n            ),\n            'enter_long'] = 1\n\n        return dataframe","position":{"start":{"line":92,"column":1},"end":{"line":122,"column":1}},"key":"BGKU6F5ftg"},{"type":"admonition","kind":"tip","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FreqAI","position":{"start":{"line":124,"column":1},"end":{"line":124,"column":1}},"key":"EPkO8wBYWV"}],"key":"e96kSpWmKw"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":125,"column":1},"end":{"line":125,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"你可以使用这个在功能强大的机器上设置 ","position":{"start":{"line":125,"column":1},"end":{"line":125,"column":1}},"key":"SPSnapwTPY"},{"type":"link","url":"/freqai","position":{"start":{"line":125,"column":1},"end":{"line":125,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"FreqAI","position":{"start":{"line":125,"column":1},"end":{"line":125,"column":1}},"key":"SOBObhrexY"}],"urlSource":"freqai.md","dataUrl":"/freqai.json","internal":true,"protocol":"file","key":"yXu3msT480"},{"type":"text","value":"，同时在树莓派等简单机器上运行消费者，这些消费者可以以不同的方式解释生产者生成的信号。","position":{"start":{"line":125,"column":1},"end":{"line":125,"column":1}},"key":"Zovr9uzox0"}],"key":"MONXOP0Bxc"}],"key":"BRN7HNXyuU"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":130,"column":1},"end":{"line":130,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"示例 - 消费者策略","position":{"start":{"line":130,"column":1},"end":{"line":130,"column":1}},"key":"i4MP9CBB9Q"}],"label":"example-consumer-strategy","identifier":"example-consumer-strategy","html_id":"example-consumer-strategy","key":"XOuuzYkOZL"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":132,"column":1},"end":{"line":132,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"一个逻辑上等效的策略，它自己不计算任何指标，但将具有相同的分析数据框可用于基于生产者在生产者中计算的指标做出交易决策。在此示例中，消费者具有相同的入场标准，但这不是必需的。消费者可以使用不同的逻辑来入场/出场交易，并且只使用指定的指标。","position":{"start":{"line":132,"column":1},"end":{"line":132,"column":1}},"key":"WWtr4cp7U1"}],"key":"hClJHk66Nj"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","value":"class ConsumerStrategy(IStrategy):\n    #...\n    process_only_new_candles = False # 消费者必需\n\n    _columns_to_expect = ['rsi_default', 'tema_default', 'bb_middleband_default']\n\n    def populate_indicators(self, dataframe: DataFrame, metadata: dict) -> DataFrame:\n        \"\"\"\n        使用 websocket api 从另一个 freqtrade 实例获取预填充的指标。\n        使用 `self.dp.get_producer_df(pair)` 获取数据框\n        \"\"\"\n        pair = metadata['pair']\n        timeframe = self.timeframe\n\n        producer_pairs = self.dp.get_producer_pairs()\n        # 你可以通过以下方式指定从哪个生产者获取交易对：\n        # self.dp.get_producer_pairs(\"my_other_producer\")\n\n        # 此函数返回分析的数据框，以及它被分析的时间\n        producer_dataframe, _ = self.dp.get_producer_df(pair)\n        # 如果生产者提供，你可以获取其他数据：\n        # self.dp.get_producer_df(\n        #   pair,\n        #   timeframe=\"1h\",\n        #   candle_type=CandleType.SPOT,\n        #   producer_name=\"my_other_producer\"\n        # )\n\n        if not producer_dataframe.empty:\n            # 如果你计划直接传递生产者的入场/出场信号，\n            # 指定 ffill=False，否则会有意外的结果\n            merged_dataframe = merge_informative_pair(dataframe, producer_dataframe,\n                                                      timeframe, timeframe,\n                                                      append_timeframe=False,\n                                                      suffix=\"default\")\n            return merged_dataframe\n        else:\n            dataframe[self._columns_to_expect] = 0\n\n        return dataframe\n\n    def populate_entry_trend(self, dataframe: DataFrame, metadata: dict) -> DataFrame:\n        \"\"\"\n        为给定的数据框填充入场信号\n        \"\"\"\n        # 使用数据框列，就像我们自己计算它们一样\n        dataframe.loc[\n            (\n                (qtpylib.crossed_above(dataframe['rsi_default'], self.buy_rsi.value)) &\n                (dataframe['tema_default'] <= dataframe['bb_middleband_default']) &\n                (dataframe['tema_default'] > dataframe['tema_default'].shift(1)) &\n                (dataframe['volume'] > 0)\n            ),\n            'enter_long'] = 1\n\n        return dataframe","position":{"start":{"line":134,"column":1},"end":{"line":191,"column":1}},"key":"p5YHiPX0mu"},{"type":"admonition","kind":"tip","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"使用上游信号","position":{"start":{"line":193,"column":1},"end":{"line":193,"column":1}},"key":"a57ywLQxkg"}],"key":"KkCdCXoMpw"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":194,"column":1},"end":{"line":194,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"通过设置 ","position":{"start":{"line":194,"column":1},"end":{"line":194,"column":1}},"key":"k8dEPBxiSH"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remove_entry_exit_signals=false","position":{"start":{"line":194,"column":1},"end":{"line":194,"column":1}},"key":"tvx3NQerEf"},{"type":"text","value":"，你也可以直接使用生产者的信号。它们应该可以作为 ","position":{"start":{"line":194,"column":1},"end":{"line":194,"column":1}},"key":"AGghSNhoTr"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"enter_long_default","position":{"start":{"line":194,"column":1},"end":{"line":194,"column":1}},"key":"Gg0SjnQ2Fz"},{"type":"text","value":" 使用（假设使用了 ","position":{"start":{"line":194,"column":1},"end":{"line":194,"column":1}},"key":"kjpbOtkZEh"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"suffix=\"default\"","position":{"start":{"line":194,"column":1},"end":{"line":194,"column":1}},"key":"PymR99qRDx"},{"type":"text","value":"）- 并且可以直接用作信号，或作为附加指标。","position":{"start":{"line":194,"column":1},"end":{"line":194,"column":1}},"key":"zZYid6BeSx"}],"key":"P32zmfiloT"}],"key":"GWhltZd2QN"}],"key":"ZrMLPmnOuk"}],"key":"dP9am0KrV9"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"高级委托流分析","short_title":"委托流分析","url":"/advanced-orderflow","group":"高级话题"},"next":{"title":"SQL 助手","short_title":"SQL 助手","url":"/sql-cheatsheet","group":"高级话题"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3001"}